      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、夏葉\r\n荷物を忘れてるぞ……おーい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013004020160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……え？　……何かしらこれ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300402/2013004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013004020170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "白鳥！？　可愛い！　可愛いわ！\r\nねぇこれ使いましょうよ、プロデューサー……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300402/2013004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013004020180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あらっプロデューサー？\r\n……どこなのプロデューサー……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300402/2013004020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今、行くから……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
